Gemma
-----
The files in edits/ are modifications of the weights of google/gemma-4-12B-it (revision
43c9d014b231474fa7212dbb48a762566c2b255d), made available as minimal diffs that must be applied to the original model.
Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms; use of the
model, including in modified form, is subject to those terms and to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy). Modification notice: the edits replace a few rows of gate_proj /
up_proj and columns of down_proj in MLP layers 29-47, as listed in each edits/*/manifest.json.

FLORES-200
----------
data/flores200_en_it_200.jsonl is an unmodified subset (200 sentences, English source and Italian reference) of the
FLORES-200 devtest set (NLLB Team et al., "No Language Left Behind", 2022), licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). That file is distributed under the same licence.

WikiText
--------
experiments/qwen27b-censorship/censura/checks/data/c0_wikitext.jsonl contains 150 unmodified passages from WikiText
(Merity et al., "Pointer Sentinel Mixture Models", 2016; https://huggingface.co/datasets/Salesforce/wikitext), licensed
under CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). That file is distributed under the same licence.

XSTest
------
experiments/qwen27b-censorship/censura/checks/data/c7_xstest_safe.jsonl contains the 250 safe prompts of XSTest
(Röttger et al., NAACL 2024; https://github.com/paul-rottger/xstest), licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Pan & Xu political-censorship battery
-------------------------------------
experiments/qwen27b-censorship/censura/checks/data/e11_panxu.jsonl contains the 145 questions of J. Pan and X. Xu,
"Political censorship in large language models originating from China", PNAS Nexus 5(2):pgag013, 2026, from their
Harvard Dataverse replication data (doi:10.7910/DVN/VQMOJU), released under CC0 1.0.

